== Redmine Reporter plugin changelog

Redmine Reporter plugin - Printable reports generation for Redmine issues
Copyright (C) 2011-2019 RedmineUP
https://www.redmineup.com/

== 2019-07-30 v1.0.3

* New filters where_custom_field and group_by_custom_field

== 2019-05-23 v1.0.2

* Added dynamic reports for saved queries 
* Added Time Entires reports
* Added statistic functions for issue: total_spent_time_by_date, time_in_status, total_time_in_status
* Added array functions (sum, avg, max, mix, median)

== 2019-02-04 v1.0.1

* Added access to attached images from report
* Added new Liquid filter custom_fields
* Fixed bug with custom field values

== 2018-10-24 v1.0.0

* Initial release
* Import/export reports
* Single/multiple issues reports
* Attach reports to selected issue
* Email reports from issue page
* Export notes, time entries and subtasks
* Project or global reports
* Issue list Reports context menu